<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Comic Sharing Invitation</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
            color: #333333;
        }
        .container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }
        .header {
            text-align: center;
            padding-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .header h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 24px;
            color: #333333;
        }
        .content p {
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin: 10px 0;
        }
        .cta-button {
            display: block;
            width: fit-content;
            margin: 20px auto;
            padding: 15px 25px;
            background-color: #007bff;
            color: #ffffff;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            font-size: 16px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #777777;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }
        .highlight {
            font-weight: bold;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>You've Been Invited to Read a Comic!</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <p>Hi there,</p>
            {# An explicit comic is not named here. The email is the one place
               the recipient cannot choose to open: it is previewed on lock
               screens and read by scanners, so the title stays behind the age
               gate along with everything else that identifies the comic. #}
            {% if explicitContent %}
                <p>
                    <span class="highlight">{{ userName|e }}</span> would like to share a comic with you.
                </p>
                <p class="highlight">
                    They have marked it as containing explicit adult content (18+).
                    You will be asked to confirm that you are 18 or older before any
                    details of the comic are shown to you.
                </p>
            {% else %}
                <p>
                    <span class="highlight">{{ userName|e }}</span> would like to share the comic
                    "<span class="highlight">{{ comic.title|e }}</span>" with you.
                </p>
            {% endif %}
            {# One link, and it only opens a preview. Mail scanners and
               link-preview services follow links without a person behind them,
               so nothing here may accept or decline on the recipient's
               behalf — that needs a button press on the page it leads to. #}
            <p>The link below shows you what is being shared. Nothing is added to your account until you choose to accept it.</p>
            <a href="{{ shareLink|e('html_attr') }}" class="cta-button" style="color: #ffffff;">Review invitation</a>
            <p>
                To accept, you'll need to log in or create an account on
                <span class="highlight">{{ siteName|e }}</span>.
            </p>
            <p>
                The comic stays owned by {{ userName|e }}. You will be able to read it
                for as long as they keep sharing it, and it may become unavailable if
                they stop sharing or remove it.
            </p>
            <p>
                This invitation link will expire on <span class="highlight">{{ expiresAt|date("F j, Y") }}</span>.
            </p>
            <p>
                You received this email because {{ userName|e }} asked {{ siteName|e }}
                to share this comic with you. If you do not know the sender or do not
                want the invitation, you can ignore this email; no account will be
                created for you.
            </p>
            <p>Happy reading!</p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>&copy; {{ "now"|date("Y") }} {{ siteName|e }}. All rights reserved.</p>
            <p><a href="{{ privacyUrl|e('html_attr') }}">Privacy information</a></p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
